"A2KDeck" is a DataBase for use by AMWAY Distributors.

I designed it to keep track of my AMWAY customers, orders and stock.

Created with ®CanDo 3.8 on an accelerated Amiga 1200 with 18 megs of RAM.

Notes: This will be my last update of this program, as I'm going to PC Land.
I was going to do some more work on the docs but I can't be stuffed. Lots of
updated features and improvments on the old version. Some realy brilliant src
code for those that have and use CanDo. I'll still keep my Amiga for fun, but
need to get into the realm of PC use, for businness.

PS.
Lots of added features and stuff.
Some features not completed yet.
Any replies would be greatfull.


